<p>Attack the target for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">200%, 216%, 229%, 240%, 250%</acronym> Nature weapon damage.</p><p>If the attack brings your target below a percent of its max life (based on talent level and relative size) or kills it, you attempt to swallow it, killing it automatically and regaining life and equilibrium depending on its level.</p><p>The target may save against your physical power to prevent this attempt.</p><p>Levels in Swallow raise your Physical and Mental critical rate by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2%, 4%, 6%, 8%, 10%.</acronym></p><p>Each point in sand drake talents increase your physical resistance by 0.5%.</p><p>This talent will also attack with your shield, if you have one equipped.</p><p></p><p>Max life threshold at your current size:</p><p>Tiny:  <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 26%, 31%, 35%, 37%</acronym></p><p>Small:  <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 20%, 23%, 26%, 29%</acronym></p><p>Medium:  <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">13%, 16%, 20%, 22%, 25%</acronym></p><p>Big:  <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">11%, 15%, 17%, 20%, 22%</acronym></p><p>Huge:  <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 13%, 16%, 18%, 20%</acronym></p><p>Gargantuan:  <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 13%, 15%, 16%, 18%</acronym></p>